  "description": "<p><strong>YozakuraKiss</strong> is a radiant anime-style model that embodies the dreamy elegance and playful charm of modern bishoujo aesthetics. Designed with versatility in mind, this model captures a wide spectrum of moods, from ethereal romance to everyday cuteness, allowing for expressive and captivating character creation.</p><p></p><p><strong>Core strengths of YozakuraKiss:</strong></p><p>- High-detail portraits with radiant lighting and flawless skin rendering.</p><p>- Versatile hairstyles and accessories that enhance individuality.</p><p>- Expressive eyes and blush tones that emphasize character emotion.</p><p>- Stunning balance of elegance, playfulness, and modern anime charm.</p><p></p><p>YozakuraKiss is ideal for creating captivating characters that blend elegance, cuteness, and personality—whether for storytelling, illustration, or stylized portraits</p><p></p><hr /><h3 id=\"my-settings:\"><strong>My Settings:</strong></h3><ul><li><p><span style=\"color:rgb(64, 192, 87)\"><strong>Positive</strong></span><strong> Prompt:</strong> masterpiece, newest,absurdres,incredibly absurdres, best quality, amazing quality, very aesthetic</p></li></ul><ul><li><p><span style=\"color:rgb(250, 82, 82)\"><strong>Negative</strong></span><strong> Prompt: </strong>lowres,bad anatomy,worst quality,low quality,normal quality,bad hands,mutated,extra fingers,artifacts,disfigured,</p></li></ul><ul><li><p><strong>Sampling Method:</strong> DPM++ 2M</p></li><li><p><strong>Schedule Type:</strong> Karras</p></li><li><p><strong>Steps:</strong> 30</p></li><li><p><strong>CFG Scale:</strong> 5</p></li><li><p><strong>Hi-Res Fix:</strong> Enabled for all images<br /><br />Use Adetailer if required.</p></li></ul><p></p>",
